    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505410/extras/be17ddca510af3fa823c81e21dba5654.avif?t=1739975445\" width=462 height=174 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bearships is a chill multiplayer chatroom-style game where bears set sail to fish, relax, and share stories. You can fish, decorate, and tend to plants around your ship. Don't forget to keep an eye out for the floating islands drifting by!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CLOUDY WITH A CHANCE OF FISH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reel in over a <strong>100</strong> skyfish species that'll keep your line busy and your belly full.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BEAUTIFUL BEAR BLING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deck out your bear with tons of different cosmetics and props that will show your lame friends just how much cooler you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WE HOPE YOU ENJOY IT :)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our goal is to create a cozy haven where you can kick back, meet new friends, and leave your worries behind after a long day.\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505410/extras/be17ddca510af3fa823c81e21dba5654.avif?t=1739975445\" width=462 height=174 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bearships is a chill multiplayer chatroom-style game where bears set sail to fish, relax, and share stories. You can fish, decorate, and tend to plants around your ship. Don't forget to keep an eye out for the floating islands drifting by!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CLOUDY WITH A CHANCE OF FISH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reel in over a <strong>100</strong> skyfish species that'll keep your line busy and your belly full.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BEAUTIFUL BEAR BLING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deck out your bear with tons of different cosmetics and props that will show your lame friends just how much cooler you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WE HOPE YOU ENJOY IT :)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our goal is to create a cozy haven where you can kick back, meet new friends, and leave your worries behind after a long day.\u00a0</p>",
